       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Ordered:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum single dose:** the usual maximum is 800 mg.\n- **Maximum daily dose:** the usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under prescriber supervision. At 6,400 mg/day, this order is double that.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, kidney injury, cardiovascular events, and fluid retention. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours as needed** (1,600\u20132,400 mg/day), the usual range for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg per day in total**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want, along with the indication if you can. I'll enter it right away. If you do want the original dose, please confirm that and I can add a note to the order. I'd still recommend checking it with pharmacy first."
